OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Faffecting Kent will soon clear,
OL,7,Fleaving a dry and cool night, with
OL,8,Fcloudy periods. Frost and fog patches
OL,9,Fmay form in any prolonged clear
OL,10,Fspells. The wind is expected to ease
OL,11,Fto a light breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA crisp morning in rural
OL,14,Fspots, with a mix of clear and cloudy
OL,15,Fperiods. Brightening up for most by
OL,16,Fthe afternoon, although some cloud may
OL,17,Flinger along the south coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
